  "title": "Val&#39;s Pumpkin Scones",
  "description": "All the flavors and spices in pumpkin pie are baked into pumpkin scones with raisins producing a tasty addition to Thanksgiving dinner or weekend brunches.",
  "authors": [
    "valc"
  ],
